# 止蝕

(pos:動詞)
<explanation>
yue:喺投資或者賭博嗰陣，當價格跌到某個水平就即刻賣出或者平倉，等自己唔會蝕得更多。亦都可以引申做喺其他情況入面，及早放棄，避免更大損失。
eng:to stop loss; to cut losses
<eg>
yue:個市跌得咁急，你要諗吓點樣止蝕先得㗎。 (go5 si5 dit3 dak1 gam3 gap1, nei5 jiu3 nam2 haa2 dim2 joeng6 zi2 sik6 sin1 dak1 gaa3.)
eng:The market is falling so fast, you need to think about how to stop your losses.
<eg>
yue:呢單生意明知冇得做，不如早啲止蝕，慳返啲時間。 (ni1 daan1 saang1 ji3 ming4 zi1 mou5 dak1 zou6, bat1 jyu4 zou2 di1 zi2 sik6, haan2 faan1 di1 si4 gaan3.)
eng:This business is clearly not going to work, so we might as well cut our losses early and save some time. [end of text]


